-2.778330                alpha0      ! 0-lift angle of attack, depends on airfoil.
14.260839                alpha1      ! Angle of attack at f=0.7, (approximately the stall angle) for AOA>alpha0. (deg)
-11.922723               alpha2      ! Angle of attack at f=0.7, (approximately the stall angle) for AOA<alpha0. (deg)
